     2705       run clcprtsl_calc-ttable in this-procedure
     2706         (input yes,
     2707          input yes,
     2708          input bf_doc-line.road-tax,
     2709          input bf_doc-line.excise,
     2710          input bf_doc-line.vat-pc,
     2711          input bf_doc-line.cons-vat-pc,
